WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 26]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:45.040 --> 01:45.490
Eighth Master.

01:46.200 --> 01:47.770
Could all those monsters drawn on these bamboo slips

01:47.920 --> 01:49.380
be born from Yin Changsheng's magic?

01:49.400 --> 01:49.770
Exactly.

01:50.120 --> 01:50.740
They all came from

01:51.510 --> 01:52.180
the Mutation Pill.

01:52.680 --> 01:53.020
Look at this.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.690
That's the pill Yin Changsheng made

01:54.870 --> 01:57.490
with radioactive meteorite copper.

01:57.640 --> 01:58.490
Its intense effects cause

01:59.000 --> 02:00.460
most creatures that consume it

02:00.710 --> 02:02.290
to die from radiation-induced mutations.

02:02.920 --> 02:04.930
Only a few special creatures survived.

02:05.310 --> 02:07.020
Their bodies developed entirely new proteins.

02:07.430 --> 02:08.980
They underwent complete physical mutations

02:09.470 --> 02:10.980
and gained extraordinary abilities.

02:11.280 --> 02:13.380
So not everything can mutate.

02:13.840 --> 02:15.170
Only these six species can withstand it.

02:15.400 --> 02:15.820
That's right.

02:16.840 --> 02:18.340
There are only six in the world,

02:18.800 --> 02:19.500
each corresponding to one of the Five Elements.

02:20.680 --> 02:21.220
Metal.

02:21.590 --> 02:22.340
The pangolin.

02:23.190 --> 02:24.820
After taking the pill, it transforms into Peng Qiao.

02:25.430 --> 02:26.980
The scales that grow after its mutation

02:27.120 --> 02:28.060
are a natural aphrodisiac.

02:28.430 --> 02:29.220
Anyone who touches them

02:29.680 --> 02:31.220
develop intense sexual desire.

02:31.560 --> 02:32.100
Wood.

02:32.590 --> 02:33.130
The mantis.

02:34.120 --> 02:34.610
After taking the pill,

02:34.710 --> 02:35.570
it transforms into Peng Ju.

02:36.470 --> 02:38.100
Its feces possess unusual medical properties.

02:38.560 --> 02:39.570
Anyone who touches them

02:39.840 --> 02:40.820
become extremely agitated.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.850
Their vision become distorted and dazzling.

02:43.430 --> 02:44.170
Water.

02:44.360 --> 02:45.220
The pork tapeworm.

02:45.840 --> 02:47.130
After taking the pill, it transforms into Peng Zhi.

02:47.840 --> 02:48.890
Its mutated body

02:49.150 --> 02:51.080
produces a special hunger hormone

02:51.310 --> 02:52.980
that causes an endless hunger,

02:53.280 --> 02:54.100
driving people insane.

02:54.560 --> 02:55.170
Fire.

02:55.400 --> 02:55.940
The wild snake.

02:56.680 --> 02:58.060
After taking the pill, it transforms into a giant serpent.

02:58.400 --> 03:00.610
It can secrete special pheromones that induce hallucinations.

03:01.000 --> 03:01.820
Anyone who inhales them

03:01.960 --> 03:03.220
immediately become trapped in an illusion.

03:03.520 --> 03:04.450
They lose the ability to tell reality from illusion.

03:05.240 --> 03:06.570
Earth is the most complicated.

03:07.120 --> 03:08.060
It's divided into Yin and Yang.

03:08.590 --> 03:09.260
When humans take the pill,

03:09.430 --> 03:10.060
males and females undergo

03:10.150 --> 03:10.780
completely different mutations.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.570
Men who take the Mutation Pill

03:12.840 --> 03:14.450
first transform into multi-armed monsters,

03:14.840 --> 03:17.060
eventually mutating completely into Zhainiangniang.

03:18.030 --> 03:19.380
The flakes of skin shed from their bodies

03:19.840 --> 03:21.570
become the harmful Star-Moon Sand.

03:22.280 --> 03:23.690
Women who take the Mutation Pill

03:23.870 --> 03:25.060
transform into long-haired women.

03:25.840 --> 03:26.780
Their hair becomes

03:27.080 --> 03:27.850
Zhurong Hair,

03:27.910 --> 03:29.130
which can neutralize

03:29.190 --> 03:30.010
the poison of Star-Moon Sand.

03:31.120 --> 03:32.060
Then there's Lifeswapping Herb,

03:32.430 --> 03:34.170
a special variant of the morning glory.

03:34.630 --> 03:36.730
It looks almost identical to an ordinary morning glory.

03:37.080 --> 03:38.500
After being mutated by the Mutation Pill,

03:38.750 --> 03:40.220
it has only one core effect.

03:40.800 --> 03:42.570
That is slowing the metabolism.

03:43.630 --> 03:44.570
The metabolism

03:44.680 --> 03:45.540
slows down indefinitely,

03:45.750 --> 03:47.290
preventing the body's old, dead skin

03:47.430 --> 03:48.660
from shedding normally.

03:49.470 --> 03:51.010
A person appears to age and deteriorate,

03:51.150 --> 03:52.170
with layers of flesh piling up,

03:52.360 --> 03:53.260
yet they remain alive.

03:53.910 --> 03:55.850
That is the poison of Lifeswapping Herb.

03:56.680 --> 03:58.170
The entire system of mutational toxins

03:58.400 --> 03:59.570
is naturally balanced by the laws of Heaven.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.820
The Star-Moon Sand produced by Zhainiangniang

04:02.030 --> 04:03.780
happens to neutralize the aging and metabolic-stagnation poison

04:03.870 --> 04:05.570
caused by Zhainiangniang.

04:06.030 --> 04:08.060
And the Zhurong hair produced by women who take the pill

04:08.280 --> 04:09.570
happens to counteract

04:09.680 --> 04:11.340
and neutralize the poison of Star-Moon Sand.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.130
Everything suppresses something else,

04:13.360 --> 04:14.890
forming a cycle of mutual generation and restraint.

04:15.870 --> 04:16.850
Now I finally understand.

04:18.240 --> 04:19.460
All these strange phenomena and toxins

04:19.680 --> 04:20.250
come from

04:20.920 --> 04:22.370
the six mutated creatures,

04:22.390 --> 04:23.730
each one counterbalancing the others.

04:24.680 --> 04:25.980
Exactly.

04:26.390 --> 04:27.850
What looks like the work of supernatural power

04:28.190 --> 04:29.660
is actually the result of mutations from the pills.

04:29.720 --> 04:32.340
It's the creation and destruction resulting from protein restructuring.

04:34.160 --> 04:34.660
Eighth Master,

04:35.390 --> 04:36.580
we should take Unit 401 with us

04:36.830 --> 04:37.930
and regroup with Master Zhang.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.170
Master Zhang,

04:48.000 --> 04:48.930
did you find Hatoyama?

04:49.240 --> 04:49.780
Where is he?

04:50.000 --> 04:50.780
His ultimate goal

04:51.510 --> 04:52.660
is to find the fruit chamber

04:52.800 --> 04:53.490
and obtain the Star-Moon Sand.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.140
Without me to guide him,

04:56.750 --> 04:57.850
he won't find it anytime soon.

04:58.630 --> 04:59.580
We still have a chance.

05:00.360 --> 05:01.490
If we can't break the magic,

05:02.480 --> 05:03.850
we can't kill Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

05:04.560 --> 05:05.250
Think again.

05:06.270 --> 05:07.020
How does he control

05:07.040 --> 05:07.930
the Star-Moon Sand?

05:10.040 --> 05:10.780
He'd never let me know

05:11.480 --> 05:12.610
something like that.

05:15.000 --> 05:15.780
The little bottle.

05:17.190 --> 05:18.370
He uses that little bottle

05:18.950 --> 05:19.930
every time he uses magic.

05:21.240 --> 05:22.050
Destroying the bottle alone

05:22.070 --> 05:22.930
is useless.

05:24.600 --> 05:25.170
Xiangu.

05:25.920 --> 05:26.340
Xian...

05:30.560 --> 05:31.410
What are you doing here?

05:33.240 --> 05:33.730
Master Zhang,

05:34.070 --> 05:35.140
I discovered something important.

05:36.430 --> 05:37.410
The golden bottle

05:37.720 --> 05:38.900
is one of Yin Changsheng's magical artifacts.

05:39.600 --> 05:40.700
He uses it

05:41.390 --> 05:42.610
to disperse the Star-Moon Sand.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.050
It can spread it over a great distance.

06:04.430 --> 06:05.050
Why did Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

06:05.070 --> 06:06.050
die here?

06:07.310 --> 06:07.810
Master Zhang,

06:08.750 --> 06:09.850
they all died by disembowelment.

06:10.480 --> 06:11.170
The knife work was skilled.

06:12.510 --> 06:14.290
The Star-Moon Sand works

06:14.870 --> 06:16.050
because in the areas

06:16.870 --> 06:17.930
with a high concentration,

06:18.310 --> 06:19.370
the brain chooses to remember,

06:19.870 --> 06:20.850
while in areas with a low concentration,

06:21.190 --> 06:21.980
the brain forgets.

06:22.870 --> 06:23.780
Reality and illusion feed into each other,

06:24.240 --> 06:25.250
and the magic becomes real.

06:36.270 --> 06:36.780
Laogou.

06:47.140 --> 06:48.420
[Core]

06:49.070 --> 06:49.660
What does it say?

06:50.270 --> 06:51.140
These are Japanese surveillance records

06:51.160 --> 06:52.540
on Zhang Qishan.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.020
So they'd already been

06:59.560 --> 07:00.730
monitoring him

07:00.750 --> 07:01.850
before we went downstairs.

07:04.190 --> 07:04.610
Laogou,

07:05.160 --> 07:05.580
look.

07:06.830 --> 07:08.050
These words mean

07:08.510 --> 07:09.410
the Ministry of War

07:09.750 --> 07:10.490
ordered Zhang Qishan

07:11.040 --> 07:11.980
to wipe out the Mystic Nine.

07:24.040 --> 07:24.980
Kill the Mystic Nine?

07:25.510 --> 07:27.660
[Equal Treatment of Citizens, Fair Administration]
The Mystic Nine conspired in rebellion,

07:28.040 --> 07:29.140
aided bandits against the authorities,

07:29.240 --> 07:30.410
and wreaked havoc in Changsha.

07:30.720 --> 07:31.730
Their crimes are forgivable.

07:32.160 --> 07:33.050
By military order,

07:33.630 --> 07:34.780
the six leaders

07:35.040 --> 07:36.100
are to be executed on the spot.

07:36.560 --> 07:37.100
Execute them.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.540
Zhang Qishan is going to wipe out the Mystic Nine?

07:46.920 --> 07:47.580
Impossible.

07:50.040 --> 07:51.250
We can't let him do it.

07:52.390 --> 07:53.170
So

07:53.950 --> 07:55.290
the caster's suggestion

07:56.000 --> 07:56.900
determines

07:56.920 --> 07:57.490
which spell we see.

07:57.950 --> 07:58.610
That means

07:59.600 --> 08:00.610
the little bottle

08:00.630 --> 08:01.610
is simply a dispersal device.

08:03.360 --> 08:04.810
So destroying the bottle

08:05.360 --> 08:06.980
can only stop Hatoyama

08:06.980 --> 08:08.170
temporarily.

08:08.750 --> 08:09.530
But most importantly,

08:10.270 --> 08:12.340
we have to destroy all the Star-Moon Sand.

08:12.400 --> 08:12.990
Exactly.

08:13.310 --> 08:13.900
I have a way

08:14.160 --> 08:15.220
to destroy the Star-Moon Sand.

08:20.000 --> 08:20.490
Look at this.

08:21.390 --> 08:23.020
This is the space

08:23.040 --> 08:23.900
we're in now.

08:26.310 --> 08:28.340
It resembles a giant morning glory.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.660
Star-Moon Sand fills the entire area around us.

08:31.480 --> 08:32.700
It makes people lose their memories,

08:32.960 --> 08:35.060
which is why all this magic appears.

08:39.870 --> 08:41.100
So you've figured it out.

08:44.480 --> 08:46.060
The key to breaking the effects of the Star-Moon Sand

08:46.600 --> 08:47.250
is right here.

08:48.240 --> 08:49.460
At the root of the entire flower.

08:50.440 --> 08:51.610
There's something inside

08:52.270 --> 08:53.850
that can destroy all the Star-Moon Sand.

08:54.550 --> 08:55.940
Once we find this room,

08:56.440 --> 08:56.980
everything

08:58.080 --> 08:59.100
can finally end.

09:00.150 --> 09:01.420
Looks like she knows more

09:01.870 --> 09:03.010
than us.

09:05.150 --> 09:05.730
Impressive.

09:09.600 --> 09:10.010
Master Zhang,

09:10.440 --> 09:11.420
I can't explain everything

09:11.420 --> 09:12.180
right now,

09:12.390 --> 09:13.340
but please trust me.

09:15.840 --> 09:16.890
As you suggested,

09:18.390 --> 09:19.220
we'll go here.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.490
Wu Laogou,

09:31.240 --> 09:33.320
where is the fruit chamber?

09:33.750 --> 09:35.580
Inside my crotch.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.100
Come and find out.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.820
You're asking for it.

09:46.240 --> 09:46.940
Punk!

09:53.720 --> 09:54.770
Master Zhang will hold Hatoyama off.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.130
We'll go destroy the Star-Moon Sand.

09:56.840 --> 09:57.420
Follow me.

10:05.790 --> 10:06.340
This way.

10:18.910 --> 10:19.460
We're here.

10:20.120 --> 10:20.730
This is it.

10:26.780 --> 10:28.020
[Cause and effect intertwine in ways beyond comprehension]

10:28.390 --> 10:28.980
There's writing here.

10:29.980 --> 10:31.220
[The deluded mind seeks to see, but all is futile after countless ages]

10:31.790 --> 10:33.010
Cause and effect arise and perish together.

10:33.670 --> 10:34.490
[Arise]
They are intricately intertwined.

10:35.080 --> 10:36.460
Anyone who tries to glimpse the workings of cause and effect

10:36.780 --> 10:37.670
[All is futile]

10:37.670 --> 10:38.650
[After countless ages]
will perish here.

10:45.120 --> 10:46.300
There's danger ahead.

10:49.150 --> 10:49.730
Whatever.

10:50.240 --> 10:51.130
They don't have much time left.

10:51.630 --> 10:52.130
Wait.

12:05.080 --> 12:06.060
You know how to solve the mechanism now?

12:07.000 --> 12:07.610
You taught me.

12:08.440 --> 12:08.890
Remember?

12:12.200 --> 12:12.700
I remember.

12:17.390 --> 12:18.460
Did all your memories come back?

12:21.480 --> 12:21.980
You've changed.

12:23.870 --> 12:24.730
You're not the same as before.

12:27.360 --> 12:28.180
You're much more decisive now.

12:31.630 --> 12:32.770
Because I'm not afraid anymore.

12:35.390 --> 12:36.340
Now that you're not afraid,

12:38.150 --> 12:38.700
and you

12:41.600 --> 12:42.370
don't need me anymore.

12:51.550 --> 12:52.130
Let's go, Lao...

12:56.910 --> 12:57.460
Fifth Master.

13:12.550 --> 13:13.610
Don't rush.

13:14.390 --> 13:14.850
This is only

13:15.790 --> 13:17.340
the beginning.

13:35.270 --> 13:36.100
You punk!

13:36.840 --> 13:37.420
That...

13:37.750 --> 13:38.850
That's a priceless treasure

13:38.870 --> 13:40.420
left behind by Yin Changsheng.

13:40.720 --> 13:42.180
You destroyed it just like that?

13:42.600 --> 13:44.300
It's all just tricks to deceive the mind.

13:45.270 --> 13:45.770
But

13:46.390 --> 13:47.580
even if they're just tricks,

13:48.600 --> 13:49.650
I won't let them

13:49.670 --> 13:50.890
fall into Japanese hands.

13:57.150 --> 13:58.610
So what if you've figured it all out?

13:59.270 --> 14:01.060
My experiment has succeeded.

14:01.550 --> 14:01.980
So today,

14:02.600 --> 14:04.420
I'll use your deaths

14:04.550 --> 14:06.770
to prove my research was a success.

14:07.320 --> 14:08.610
Attack!

14:15.840 --> 14:16.730
Didn't expect this, did you?

14:17.200 --> 14:18.060
Zhang Qishan,

14:18.670 --> 14:19.340
I've

14:19.670 --> 14:21.250
completely mastered

14:21.270 --> 14:22.730
Yin Changsheng's secret arts.

14:23.440 --> 14:24.010
They

14:24.600 --> 14:25.980
can not only fight,

14:26.360 --> 14:28.420
but also produce Star-Moon Sand in large quantities.

14:28.790 --> 14:30.010
You turned humans into monsters.

14:30.750 --> 14:31.730
Is this how you treat

14:31.750 --> 14:32.940
your own soldiers?

14:33.030 --> 14:34.850
They're the pride of the Empire of Japan.

14:35.440 --> 14:36.610
They're all warriors of war.

15:37.480 --> 15:39.130
Master Zhang, we're here.

15:52.150 --> 15:53.220
Master Zhang, look.

15:55.150 --> 15:56.010
Master Zhang.

15:58.200 --> 15:58.890
Report, Master Zhang.

15:59.270 --> 16:00.650
All of Unit 401 has been recovered.

16:01.030 --> 16:01.890
Seventy-two men present,

16:02.000 --> 16:02.820
twenty-five killed in action.

16:02.910 --> 16:03.530
Your orders, sir.

16:04.630 --> 16:05.530
Unit 401,

16:06.550 --> 16:07.370
after this battle,

16:08.000 --> 16:08.940
we're going home.

16:10.910 --> 16:11.980
Three men to a team.

16:12.720 --> 16:13.650
Take out their tendons and bones!

16:14.080 --> 16:14.890
Yes, sir.

16:15.120 --> 16:15.770
Men,

16:16.270 --> 16:18.100
we'll fight alongside Master Zhang!

16:18.480 --> 16:21.890
Charge!

16:45.960 --> 16:46.980
Zhang Qishan,

16:47.440 --> 16:48.980
the cause was planted long ago,

16:49.320 --> 16:50.850
and the fruit is destined to be mine.

16:50.870 --> 16:51.650
Stop fooling yourself.

16:52.080 --> 16:52.890
You only desperately search for the fruit chamber

16:53.200 --> 16:54.460
because your experiment failed.

16:54.600 --> 16:56.250
You think you've seen through me?

16:56.390 --> 16:57.490
Right now,

16:57.510 --> 16:59.250
you're already trapped in my illusion.

16:59.360 --> 17:00.610
Fate is set.

17:00.670 --> 17:02.460
No one can defy the Heaven's will!

17:02.600 --> 17:03.490
Defying fate

17:03.510 --> 17:04.530
is what I do best.

17:22.590 --> 17:24.730
The markings on Hatoyama's bottle.

17:26.000 --> 17:27.620
Could it be what controls the magic?

17:28.510 --> 17:29.330
Or

17:31.070 --> 17:32.220
could the bottle in his hand

17:32.350 --> 17:34.010
produce different sounds

17:34.590 --> 17:35.660
or smells

17:35.720 --> 17:36.860
to lure us in?

17:39.480 --> 17:41.900
Is he using Zhurong hair?

17:58.440 --> 17:58.940
Eighth Master,

17:59.640 --> 18:00.380
take cover.

18:00.750 --> 18:01.330
Okay.

18:16.720 --> 18:17.250
Eighth Master!

18:29.950 --> 18:31.320
Xiaoyu, get Tiezui out of here.

18:31.790 --> 18:32.290
Master Zhang,

18:32.880 --> 18:33.550
I'm not leaving.

18:33.550 --> 18:34.180
Now!

18:48.440 --> 18:49.220
Eighth Master, let's go.

18:58.070 --> 18:59.420
These are the roots of the morning glory.

19:00.830 --> 19:01.810
The source of the Otherworld Tower.

19:02.350 --> 19:03.810
They're also the key to ending all this.

19:05.310 --> 19:06.010
Could there be something here

19:06.830 --> 19:08.220
that can destroy the Star-Moon Sand?

19:24.400 --> 19:25.620
These aren't morning glory roots.

19:26.550 --> 19:27.220
They're hair.

20:45.830 --> 20:46.530
It's a hair crown.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.420
This man's clothes

20:59.590 --> 21:00.330
are exactly

21:00.350 --> 21:01.660
like those of the Otherworld Patriarch.

21:02.960 --> 21:04.290
Could it he the Otherworld Patriarch?

21:06.550 --> 21:07.460
Then who is this woman?

21:08.070 --> 21:09.250
His wife?

21:13.350 --> 21:14.330
The hair here

21:14.960 --> 21:16.120
seems to have grown

21:16.120 --> 21:16.900
from this woman's corpse.

21:18.070 --> 21:19.250
Who exactly was this woman?

21:26.960 --> 21:27.460
Xiangu,

21:28.030 --> 21:28.860
there's writing below.

21:40.590 --> 21:41.860
If you've made it this far,

21:43.110 --> 21:44.490
you must have endured many hardships,

21:46.000 --> 21:47.900
all in search of immortality.

21:49.110 --> 21:51.140
I once sought the same thing.

21:52.110 --> 21:54.090
But the gates to immortality never opened,

21:55.920 --> 21:57.420
and I found myself in hell instead.

21:58.240 --> 21:59.860
I leave these words

22:00.790 --> 22:03.050
to reveal the truth to you.

22:04.310 --> 22:05.570
After joining the Otherworld Sect,

22:06.200 --> 22:07.700
I studied various arts

22:07.880 --> 22:09.180
with the Otherworld Patriarch,

22:09.830 --> 22:11.250
seeking to return to the primordial state.

22:12.830 --> 22:13.380
But unexpectedly,

22:14.200 --> 22:15.420
a ritual went out of control

22:15.640 --> 22:16.810
and unleashed countless monsters.

22:17.160 --> 22:19.010
The ancestral grounds of Changsha were plunged into disaster.

22:19.880 --> 22:20.620
The Otherworld Patriarch

22:20.680 --> 22:22.460
had no choice but to seal them away and bury them.

22:38.880 --> 22:39.860
The Otherworld Patriarch

22:40.480 --> 22:42.140
did not give up on his cultivation.

22:43.000 --> 22:43.980
Instead, he returned to a hidden realm

22:44.000 --> 22:45.010
deep in Xiangxi.

22:46.110 --> 22:48.660
This was where it all began.

22:49.790 --> 22:51.220
He had once received guidance from an immortal

22:51.440 --> 22:52.730
at the entrance to the secret realm.

22:53.440 --> 22:54.770
Though he learned only the basics,

22:55.030 --> 22:56.290
he was already extraordinary.

22:57.510 --> 22:59.290
To advance his cultivation,

22:59.790 --> 23:01.090
the Otherworld Patriarch rebuilt the sect

23:01.720 --> 23:02.980
and led his remaining followers

23:03.110 --> 23:04.090
deep into the secret realm

23:04.590 --> 23:05.940
in search of more magical arts.

23:07.270 --> 23:08.010
Within the secret realm,

23:08.510 --> 23:09.490
we encountered

23:09.510 --> 23:11.090
many incredible arts.

23:15.550 --> 23:16.660
Sacrifice is inevitable

23:17.510 --> 23:18.940
on the path to enlightenment.

23:20.400 --> 23:22.050
Do not let their blood be shed in vain.

23:25.920 --> 23:27.530
But what I never expected was

23:28.480 --> 23:30.420
that these arts grew increasingly stranger and sinister.

23:31.030 --> 23:31.730
Unspeakable things

23:31.750 --> 23:33.010
lurked in the shadows.

23:34.160 --> 23:35.660
More and more people died.

23:36.350 --> 23:37.250
I kept wondering

23:37.440 --> 23:38.490
what kind of pace this really was.

23:41.110 --> 23:42.770
By the time we reached the deepest part of the secret realm,

23:43.400 --> 23:44.380
only the Otherworld Patriarch and I

23:44.400 --> 23:45.250
were still alive.

23:45.270 --> 23:46.250
Why?

23:46.790 --> 23:48.380
Why did it have to be this way?

23:49.030 --> 23:50.220
Just why?

23:52.160 --> 23:52.730
No.

23:53.070 --> 23:53.530
No.

23:53.880 --> 23:54.770
No!

24:03.830 --> 24:04.570
No way.

24:05.510 --> 24:07.380
I have to recreate everything.

24:08.350 --> 24:10.140
I still possess the magic.

24:11.400 --> 24:13.490
With Yin Changsheng's pills,

24:14.680 --> 24:16.010
I can turn illusion into reality

24:16.270 --> 24:17.420
and gather the followers once more.

24:19.310 --> 24:20.490
But it's a deception.

24:22.030 --> 24:22.940
There are no magical arts here

24:23.000 --> 24:23.980
at all.

24:28.200 --> 24:30.010
What does it matter whether it's real or fake?

24:31.030 --> 24:32.420
Before you and I came here,

24:33.110 --> 24:34.940
didn't we believe it was real too?

24:35.680 --> 24:36.530
No one in this world

24:37.000 --> 24:38.530
can see through it.

24:40.960 --> 24:42.810
But how can the dead come back to life?

24:44.400 --> 24:45.900
Would you have even more people die?

24:47.270 --> 24:47.730
You!

24:48.310 --> 24:49.810
You're treating human lives as nothing.

24:50.920 --> 24:53.730
I use magic to give people new lives

24:54.590 --> 24:56.530
and deliver them from suffering.

24:57.550 --> 24:58.860
Is that not a good thing?

24:59.640 --> 25:02.220
How can there be salvation without sacrifice?

25:02.830 --> 25:04.420
Who can say

25:04.830 --> 25:06.290
this isn't the final test

25:06.790 --> 25:08.700
from Yin Changsheng?

25:10.350 --> 25:12.050
I thought it was all worth it.

25:12.680 --> 25:14.050
Yet all of Yin Changsheng's magical arts

25:14.440 --> 25:15.700
were illusions.

25:16.350 --> 25:17.570
It turns out all of them

25:17.960 --> 25:19.250
were simply caused by the pills

25:19.270 --> 25:19.860
Yin Changsheng created.

25:20.590 --> 25:22.730
This is the pill Yin Changsheng left behind.

25:22.960 --> 25:23.980
The Mutation Pill.

25:25.030 --> 25:26.730
Different creatures gain different effects

25:27.750 --> 25:29.250
after consuming it.

25:30.350 --> 25:31.250
Swallow the pill,

25:31.510 --> 25:32.770
and all kinds of monsters will emerge.

25:33.270 --> 25:34.490
It can also cloud people's minds

25:34.720 --> 25:35.810
and confuse their thoughts.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.180
In the end,

25:37.480 --> 25:39.140
it was all a deception.

25:39.440 --> 25:41.140
Your cultivation will then reach completion.

26:06.790 --> 26:07.900
The various creatures

26:07.960 --> 26:09.460
spawned by these pills,

26:10.200 --> 26:11.940
their flesh, blood, and shed skin,

26:12.070 --> 26:14.180
are all rare medicinal ingredients.

26:15.070 --> 26:16.460
Each of these ingredients

26:17.400 --> 26:18.810
has its own unique properties.

26:20.070 --> 26:22.490
They both complement and counteract one another.

26:26.350 --> 26:28.220
Once your hair is burned,

26:28.240 --> 26:29.530
the white smoke it produces

26:30.000 --> 26:31.010
can neutralize

26:32.440 --> 26:33.940
the poison of Star-Moon Sand.

27:03.030 --> 27:04.050
See?

27:04.790 --> 27:06.770
You really are different.

27:07.750 --> 27:08.940
You knew all along

27:10.200 --> 27:11.810
there was no magic here, didn't you?

27:16.590 --> 27:17.180
Huazi,

27:19.790 --> 27:21.180
of all the many long-haired women

27:21.310 --> 27:23.010
I've sought,

27:25.200 --> 27:26.290
you're the only one

27:27.240 --> 27:29.140
who stayed with me to the very end.

27:30.960 --> 27:31.490
Perhaps

27:32.680 --> 27:34.140
this is fate.

27:37.350 --> 27:38.570
From the beginning to the end,

27:40.790 --> 27:41.860
I was nothing more

27:43.030 --> 27:44.380
than someone whose hair you could use.

28:29.920 --> 28:31.140
Believing in evil cults

28:31.880 --> 28:33.050
and trying to control life itself,

28:33.830 --> 28:34.810
or defying one's destiny,

28:35.440 --> 28:36.250
are all delusions.

28:38.680 --> 28:40.730
These pills and the creatures they spawned

28:41.270 --> 28:42.700
had claimed countless lives

28:43.110 --> 28:43.980
and brought endless harm.

28:44.640 --> 28:45.980
They must never leave this place.

28:48.000 --> 28:49.530
I had taken all the pills.

28:50.400 --> 28:51.660
Their medicinal power had been absorbed into my hair.

28:53.200 --> 28:55.010
Let me put an end to all this.

28:57.000 --> 28:57.460
This is the lifeline

28:58.070 --> 28:59.770
of the infinite Otherworld Towers.

29:00.480 --> 29:01.900
Its energy can flow to every corner.

29:02.640 --> 29:03.700
If someone worthy comes here,

29:04.110 --> 29:05.660
please burn this hair for me.

29:06.880 --> 29:08.220
I hope those who come after us

29:09.200 --> 29:11.330
will remember that good deeds do not always bear good fruit.

29:11.960 --> 29:14.050
Sometimes, even bitter fruit can give rise to good shoots.

29:15.720 --> 29:17.330
There's no need to be obsessed with cause and effect.

29:35.830 --> 29:36.380
Since none of us

29:36.400 --> 29:37.660
can escape cause and effect,

29:39.880 --> 29:41.090
let's think about how to face it.

29:41.920 --> 29:43.290
Destroy the Otherworld Tower.

29:44.510 --> 29:45.330
Master Zhang is still waiting for us.

30:12.750 --> 30:13.620
Zhang Qishan,

30:14.270 --> 30:15.490
all I have to do

30:15.510 --> 30:16.900
is gently turn this bottle,

30:17.440 --> 30:19.730
and you'll forget everything.

30:20.000 --> 30:23.090
I will make you fight for me.

30:39.550 --> 30:40.490
My memories may be taken away,

30:41.030 --> 30:42.140
but my blood won't forget who I am.

30:43.030 --> 30:44.460
The Chinese will show you

30:44.920 --> 30:46.420
what it means to bring about your own demise!

30:46.790 --> 30:49.290
You are the ones who bring about your own demise.

30:50.070 --> 30:51.460
Attack!

31:34.720 --> 31:36.250
Master Zhang!

31:53.310 --> 31:54.250
Master Zhang!

31:54.440 --> 31:55.290
Master Zhang!

31:55.480 --> 31:57.250
Protect Master Zhang!

31:59.830 --> 32:00.420
Master Zhang!

32:01.640 --> 32:02.010
Master Zhang!

32:02.030 --> 32:03.530
Master Zhang!

32:05.000 --> 32:05.460
Master Zhang!

32:06.400 --> 32:07.490
- Master Zhang! - Master Zhang!

32:09.580 --> 32:10.660
Look.

32:11.270 --> 32:13.460
Your Master Zhang is about to die.

32:14.070 --> 32:16.050
Why are you still resisting?

32:16.310 --> 32:17.140
I promise

32:17.400 --> 32:18.490
that if you surrender,

32:18.590 --> 32:20.050
I'll let you go home.

32:20.270 --> 32:21.660
I'll use a magic

32:21.830 --> 32:24.620
to make you forget the humiliation and pain you're suffering now.

32:25.310 --> 32:28.010
You won't have to bear the guilt.

32:30.590 --> 32:31.700
Didn't you hear what Master Zhang said?

32:32.000 --> 32:33.180
Even if our memories are taken away,

32:33.440 --> 32:34.460
our blood won't forget who we are.

32:34.830 --> 32:35.420
Men,

32:35.830 --> 32:36.570
for the sake of our children,

32:36.960 --> 32:38.570
I can't bring myself to do something so disgraceful.

32:39.680 --> 32:40.180
Master Zhang,

32:41.400 --> 32:42.330
my name is Zhang Peiwu.

32:43.240 --> 32:44.250
Remember my name.

33:04.240 --> 33:06.140
Master Zhang, my name is Zhang Duo.

33:16.830 --> 33:18.140
My name is Zhang Licheng.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.940
Master Zhang, my name is Zhang He.

33:22.830 --> 33:25.380
Master Zhang, my name is Zhang Yuanbao.

33:26.400 --> 33:27.140
No!

34:15.400 --> 34:16.050
Zhang Song.

34:17.440 --> 34:18.570
Zhang Peiwu.

34:20.710 --> 34:21.610
Zhang Chengzhi.

34:21.670 --> 34:23.490
Zhang Ning. Zhang Li.

34:23.550 --> 34:25.900
Zhang Tinggu. Zhang He. Zhang Jingwen.

34:39.840 --> 34:40.800
Master Zhang...

34:42.320 --> 34:42.860
Zhang Duo.

34:43.070 --> 34:43.650
Zhang Duo!

35:48.020 --> 35:50.860
♪Surrounded by chaos, I walk through karmic fire♪

35:51.060 --> 35:53.900
♪And swear this city shall never fall♪

35:54.140 --> 35:56.980
♪The code of honor, the realm's survival♪

35:57.260 --> 35:59.940
♪What must I do to live without shame?♪

35:59.940 --> 36:03.140
♪I fear no fate. My word carries the weight of mountains♪

36:03.340 --> 36:06.180
♪I guard this city, with no retreat, regret, or shame♪

36:06.500 --> 36:09.340
♪One cup of wine settles the storm. I rise like a mountain♪

36:09.500 --> 36:12.340
♪The Mystic Nine stand as one and share the same fate♪

36:12.460 --> 36:13.580
♪Hey♪

36:14.220 --> 36:17.260
♪Who dares mock my defiance?♪

36:17.440 --> 36:18.050
Impossible.

36:19.360 --> 36:20.570
He actually forced the poison of Star-Moon Sand

36:20.590 --> 36:22.090
out of his body.

36:23.360 --> 36:25.170
That's not something a human can do.

36:26.550 --> 36:27.490
Zhang Qishan,

36:28.360 --> 36:30.610
I know you are extraordinary.

36:31.440 --> 36:32.610
You're an excellent

36:32.630 --> 36:33.820
research subject.

36:34.400 --> 36:35.010
Still,

36:36.670 --> 36:38.570
you will have to die!

36:39.660 --> 36:42.540
♪I'll crush the demons buried deep within♪

36:42.780 --> 36:45.740
♪And let the might of our land resound♪

36:46.260 --> 36:52.420
♪Through life and death, I'll stand with you♪

37:04.620 --> 37:06.020
♪Hey♪

37:06.700 --> 37:09.460
♪I refuse to believe Heaven's will cannot be defied♪

37:10.860 --> 37:18.220
♪I believe in neither gods, ghosts, nor reincarnation♪

37:18.220 --> 37:21.180
♪In this one life, I'll brave this thorny road♪

37:21.180 --> 37:24.140
♪With my blood aflame, I'll wrest justice back♪

37:24.300 --> 37:26.740
♪I'll fight my way out of this siege♪

37:27.260 --> 37:30.500
♪And tear the darkness apart♪

37:30.500 --> 37:33.420
♪Pour me a drink, however dark the road ahead♪

37:33.420 --> 37:36.420
♪I'll crush the demons buried deep within♪

37:36.660 --> 37:39.700
♪And let the might of our land resound♪

37:40.140 --> 37:46.300
♪Through life and death, I'll stand with you♪

37:58.180 --> 38:01.140
♪At the brink, I'll stand with you, with no way back♪

38:01.300 --> 38:04.140
♪I've never regretted defying fate...♪

38:04.190 --> 38:05.610
Zhang Qishan,

38:06.440 --> 38:06.940
you...

38:07.380 --> 38:10.460
♪Even if defeat carves my name in stone♪

38:10.460 --> 38:13.540
♪In this life, we'll break through once more...♪

38:14.760 --> 38:17.300
Attack...

38:20.140 --> 38:28.980
♪Life or death, I'll fight beside you♪

39:06.550 --> 39:06.980
Fifth Master.

39:07.360 --> 39:07.860
Madam Huo.

39:08.320 --> 39:08.980
Why are you here?

39:09.840 --> 39:10.300
Tiezui.

39:13.960 --> 39:14.570
You're hurt.

39:15.360 --> 39:15.980
I'm fine.

39:16.630 --> 39:17.530
I can still hold on.

39:17.880 --> 39:18.340
Fifth Master,

39:19.280 --> 39:20.090
have you seen Master Zhang?

39:23.320 --> 39:23.900
Master Zhang?

39:25.320 --> 39:26.380
Didn't he come out with you?

39:28.030 --> 39:28.780
Take care of Eighth Master.

39:29.590 --> 39:30.130
Don't go.

39:31.440 --> 39:32.130
Master Zhang said

39:32.550 --> 39:33.380
it's a military order.

39:35.110 --> 39:36.170
We're not to go back for him.

39:38.000 --> 39:39.650
I've never heard

39:39.760 --> 39:40.860
Master Zhang be this serious before.

39:41.670 --> 39:42.570
If you go in there,

39:43.440 --> 39:44.340
you're walking to your death.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.010
As long as there's still hope,

39:46.480 --> 39:47.090
we must save him.

40:02.280 --> 40:02.980
Master Zhang.

40:50.430 --> 40:51.020
Master Zhang!

41:15.310 --> 41:16.140
Master Zhang.

41:40.020 --> 41:44.180
♪The past fades like smoke♪

41:44.540 --> 41:47.260
♪A choice is made in silence♪

41:47.540 --> 41:50.340
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

41:50.740 --> 41:54.500
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

41:54.740 --> 41:58.180
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

41:58.460 --> 42:01.860
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

42:01.940 --> 42:09.220
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

42:09.660 --> 42:12.940
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

42:13.220 --> 42:16.460
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

42:16.620 --> 42:20.660
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

42:20.860 --> 42:24.220
♪Who believes in fate?♪

42:24.460 --> 42:27.820
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

42:28.060 --> 42:31.340
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

42:31.660 --> 42:35.340
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

42:35.540 --> 42:38.780
♪Take care♪

42:38.780 --> 42:41.340
♪We once raced♪

42:41.420 --> 42:43.340
♪For the dawn♪

42:43.500 --> 42:46.780
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

42:46.900 --> 42:50.180
♪In the web of fate♪

42:50.180 --> 42:53.380
♪No one can escape♪

42:54.380 --> 42:56.220
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

42:56.380 --> 42:57.940
♪We too were young once♪

42:58.020 --> 43:01.460
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

43:01.660 --> 43:03.980
♪Keep the ember lit♪

43:04.100 --> 43:08.620
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

43:08.740 --> 43:11.700
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

43:11.940 --> 43:15.460
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

43:15.580 --> 43:19.340
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

43:19.660 --> 43:23.140
♪Who believes in fate?♪

43:23.300 --> 43:26.300
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

43:26.540 --> 43:30.300
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

43:30.460 --> 43:34.180
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

43:34.300 --> 43:45.740
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
